{{> header}}

<h2>Update your details</h2>

{{#if sent}}
    <p>If that email address belongs to an approved member, we've sent a link you
        can use to update your details. It expires in 24 hours — check your inbox.</p>
{{else}}
    <p>Already a member? Enter the email you joined with and we'll send you a link
        to edit your name, website, and country. (Your email address itself can't be
        changed here.)</p>

    <form method="POST" action="/update">
        <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="{{csrfToken}}">
        <label>Email<br><input type="email" name="email" required></label><br>
        <button type="submit">Email me an update link</button>
    </form>
{{/if}}
